{
  "id": "ECC.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Omorandia 10",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chingi chikwete nigo chikogundia amaguta akweakwa atioka bobe; naboigo na oboriri obosinini bokobua obong’aini na amasikani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkoro y’omonto omong’aini nigo ekomoraa gochia borio",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", korende ey’omoriri nigo ekomoraa gochia bomosi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya nekero omonto omoriri agotaara inchera nigo akoborwa okomanya, na igo omanyia kera omonto ng’a ere nomoriri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omogambi karabe nendamwamu asore, tobaisa gotiga emeremo yao, ekiagera oboremereria nigo boragere ebibe ebinene biaberwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiga inse y’erioba narorire obobe, na obobe obo nigo bokorentwa nabagaambi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoriri nigo akoegwa amasikani amanene, ekero abanto abanda bagendererete goikaransa aase a inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Narorire abasomba bariinete chibarasi, na abagaambi bagotaara namagoro buna abasomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto ogokunya engoro, nere oragwe imeo, na oyo okobochora enyasi, eng’iti engenda inse nemorome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo ogwatia amagena nigo araakwe naro, na oyo ogwatia emete, ande nanyore obokong’u asero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto tagotieria ekioma ekero giatuire, rirorio goika abeeke chinguru chinyinge ase ogokora emeremo nakerokio, korende obong’aini nigo bogokonya omonto abue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoebia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ching’iti ching’enda inse aise gotiga eng’iti emorome ritang’ani atarayeebia, rirorio omoebia oyio nigo arabe bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana akorua ase omonto omong’aini nigo akogera bwanchwa, korende aya akorua ase ebikoba bi’omoriri nigo akomosiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyio omoriri nigo agochaka gokwana amang’ana ’oboriri, naende oyakoora nobobarimo obobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoriri nigo are omonyamang’ana mange. Monto onde tamanyeti aya agochia koba. Ning’o oranyare komoteebia ekegochia koba korwa magega yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emeremo y’omoriri nigo ekomoorosia, goika osinywa komanya enchera ekogenda ase omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobe nobwao, aye ense, ekero omorwoti oo are omwana, na abagaambi bao bakobeera ase emeyega y’okwegokia ase chingaki chia mambia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nosesenirie aye ense, ekero omorwoti oo are omonto omosike na omosibore; na abarai bao bakoragera ase engaki egwenerete, ase okonyora chinguru, korende tari ase ogotinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omonto are omworo ekerama ki’enyomba yaye nigo gekogwa, na ase engencho y’obworo obwo embura nigo egotwa imeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emeyega ye chindagera nigo ekorenta omogooko, na edivai nigo egokora omonto bweigwa buya, na ase chitaabu nonyare kogora ebinto bionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koragereria omorwoti nonya nase ebirengererio biao, gose tobaisa koragereria omonto omonda ekero ore ase akanyomba kao g’okorara. Oise gokora bo, enyoni nebaise koira amang’ana ao, gose egetongwa kere ne chimbaaba ngetebe amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
